      "en": "Behold, they brought to him a man who was paralyzed, lying on a bed. Jesus, seeing their faith, said to the paralytic, “Son, cheer up! Your sins are forgiven you.”",
      "ko": "침상에 누운 중풍병자를 사람들이 데리고 오거늘 예수께서 저희의 믿음을 보시고 중풍병자에게 이르시되 소자야 안심하라 네 죄 사함을 받았느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0d6be429eb34d4e294f89f31b45cc88d05aa8fbb27312b77c124956d5d80acda",
      "translation_text_hash": "732bed44ffe9c197c4f5133fd10d65f677427dc2e1b7788f6e6431e1d05400a1",
