      "en": "When the Pharisees saw it, they said to his disciples, “Why does your teacher eat with tax collectors and sinners?”",
      "ko": "바리새인들이 보고 그 제자들에게 이르되 어찌하여 너희 선생은 세리와 죄인들과 함께 잡수시느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "d578252adda598167ef8d049fceefd99215812c18a548c5d0402ca4838554bbb",
      "translation_text_hash": "fe803b00bb019d90ef4de1652db8efdfd437b3d7cdcc04478a10613ff5cdd401",
